WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:06.807
A very long time ago, maybe 6,000 years,

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:11.345
a fishing people came
and settled on the waters of this lake.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.548
They're called the Mohana.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.450
The bird fishermen.

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:52.585
The pelican, of all birds,
is the hardest to catch.

00:00:57.124 --> 00:00:59.258
Ramzan, the red, calls him kodu.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:00.960
Little Man.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:03.664
From now on,
he's a new son for his clan.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:08.635
Ramzan, the red, says his family
was the first to settle on this lake.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.808
But another family has always
claimed that it was here long before.

00:01:18.679 --> 00:01:21.148
The family of Mohammed, the yellow.

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:45.404
The pelican is the most desired of birds.

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:49.041
It brings honor and prosperity
to the family that owns it.

00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:53.580
Only two families in this village
know how to capture the pelican.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.582
Mohammed and Ramzan's.

00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:59.185
So far this year, Mohammed,
the yellow, hasn't had the privilege.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:51.438
The Mohana have a passion for birds.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.707
Their grace and their beauty.

00:02:54.373 --> 00:02:56.677
They need their presence
always and everywhere.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.945
That is why they collect them.

00:03:07.386 --> 00:03:09.322
Each family has its own bird garden.

00:03:10.524 --> 00:03:12.225
A place outside the village.

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:15.429
Where they can admire them
and talk with them at leisure.

00:03:33.679 --> 00:03:38.184
The beauty of a garden lies in the art
of finding a place for each bird,

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.419
as in a painting.

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:47.960
Ramzan, the red, has asked his sons
to enthrone Little Man like a king.

00:04:57.029 --> 00:04:59.566
In a few days, the pelicans will be gone.

00:04:59.933 --> 00:05:03.203
They come from Kazakhstan
and migrate to Arabia.

00:05:03.337 --> 00:05:06.440
On their way, they land
for a mere three weeks on the lake.

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:08.308
If they land at all.

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:17.851
Mohammed, the yellow,
has sworn he'll get one.

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:21.321
And it's got nothing to do
with Ramzan, the red.

00:06:47.473 --> 00:06:50.644
The waters of the lake
belong to Lord Zamindar.

00:06:51.445 --> 00:06:52.713
He owns every drop.

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:56.049
From the deepest waters
to the unhealthiest swamps.

00:06:57.518 --> 00:07:00.454
He is the one who grants the fishing
and hunting rights to the family.

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:37.157
In exchange
for granting the fishing rights,

00:07:37.356 --> 00:07:40.627
the lord receives as tribute
half of the fish caught

00:07:40.694 --> 00:07:41.962
and half the birds.

00:07:42.428 --> 00:07:45.665
Every year, he redistributes
the most fish abundant waters

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:46.967
to the best fishermen.

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:49.769
The weakest always get the poorest waters.

00:08:17.397 --> 00:08:20.766
It has been days since Mohammed,
the yellow, has fished or hunted.

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:24.104
He has spent all his time
hunting for a pelican.

00:08:24.838 --> 00:08:26.540
If he is unable to make a tribute,

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:29.209
the lord will either reduce
his fishing territory

00:08:29.276 --> 00:08:30.677
or take it away altogether.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.012
Disgrace.

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:38.184
It's always the same thing
between Ramzan and Mohammed.

00:08:38.885 --> 00:08:40.219
It starts with taunts.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.189
How it ends is anybody's guess.

00:08:47.794 --> 00:08:50.796
The whole village is involved,
including the children.

00:08:51.431 --> 00:08:52.932
But no one dares say anything.

00:09:11.952 --> 00:09:14.187
The pelican is a most intelligent bird.

00:09:14.388 --> 00:09:16.289
But also one of the most dangerous.

00:09:16.989 --> 00:09:20.193
With one stab of his beak,
Little Man can put out an eye.

00:09:56.729 --> 00:09:59.166
It takes several days to cajole the beast.

00:09:59.265 --> 00:10:00.299
And power.

00:10:01.869 --> 00:10:02.969
A lot of power.

00:10:26.492 --> 00:10:28.328
When he accepts his new family,

00:10:28.494 --> 00:10:31.565
the bird becomes faithful
and stops acting aggressively.

00:10:32.065 --> 00:10:34.601
It is then that Ramzan
can bring him to the village

00:10:34.668 --> 00:10:37.671
and show him off to everyone,
as well as his own pride.

00:10:49.416 --> 00:10:52.518
Mohammed, the yellow,
won't make a step outside his home.

00:10:53.119 --> 00:10:57.124
He is sure that the villagers
are all making fun of him, with Ramzan.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.565
His sons have no other choice.

00:11:05.932 --> 00:11:07.768
As long as they don't have a pelican,

00:11:07.835 --> 00:11:10.637
Mohammed, the yellow,
forbids them to talk to other families.

00:11:11.171 --> 00:11:12.271
A question of dignity.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:16.210
And for a Mohana son,
his father's word is law.

00:11:59.453 --> 00:12:01.455
It's a crisis in the village.

00:12:01.788 --> 00:12:04.023
The other families are cautious as cats.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:07.528
Their every move
is judged by the two rivals.

00:12:08.127 --> 00:12:10.697
Judged and remembered, for later.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.651
When they were young,

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.588
Ramzan and Mohammed
were the best of friends.

00:14:47.721 --> 00:14:49.322
But their parents fell out.

00:14:49.789 --> 00:14:51.190
No one remembers why.

00:14:51.958 --> 00:14:55.127
The children moved apart
and in time became enemies.

00:15:08.775 --> 00:15:11.445
This year, Mohammed
won't have his pelican.

00:15:11.512 --> 00:15:12.880
He must give up trying.

00:15:13.247 --> 00:15:15.616
And think about
fishing to feed his family.

00:15:31.731 --> 00:15:35.202
The Mohanas say they learned
everything they know from the birds.

00:15:35.568 --> 00:15:39.505
The art of fishing and hunting,
and a lot of other things about life.

00:16:22.448 --> 00:16:24.585
If they keep on capturing birds,

00:16:25.018 --> 00:16:27.453
it is to observe them, to imitate them.

00:16:31.124 --> 00:16:33.593
Captured birds attract the wild ones,

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:35.661
and the cycle continues.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:40.867
Little Man's presence
reassures the wild ducks.

00:16:41.268 --> 00:16:42.969
Hunting is easier with him around.

00:18:23.937 --> 00:18:27.374
Ramzan has invited
the dignitaries from the other villages

00:18:27.441 --> 00:18:29.475
to solemnly celebrate the pelican.

00:18:29.876 --> 00:18:32.345
Mohammed, the yellow,
has turned down his invitation,

00:18:32.446 --> 00:18:35.548
and Ramzan did nothing
to make him change his mind.

00:18:41.454 --> 00:18:43.957
For Ramzan's son, it's going too far.

00:18:44.625 --> 00:18:46.225
Vanity blinds his father.

00:18:49.229 --> 00:18:51.397
But when you are the son of a Mohana,

00:18:51.564 --> 00:18:54.535
you learn from birth to bend like a reed.

00:19:45.686 --> 00:19:47.687
Old Ramzan, the red, was right.

00:19:48.187 --> 00:19:50.489
His pelican was bound to attract another.

00:19:50.624 --> 00:19:52.692
Just a matter of time and patience.

00:20:19.552 --> 00:20:22.456
This new pelican
will not be for Ramzan, the red.

00:20:22.688 --> 00:20:24.557
The conflict has gone on long enough.

00:20:28.362 --> 00:20:32.198
Between the two families,
feuds have always created more feuds.

00:20:32.566 --> 00:20:36.703
As usual, it is the children who try
to open the road to reconciliation.

00:20:56.355 --> 00:20:58.425
The pride of the elders is so great

00:20:58.525 --> 00:21:01.061
that the young ones
have to learn the art of ruse.

00:21:04.964 --> 00:21:08.734
Migrating birds often
get tangled up in the fishermen's nets.

00:21:09.068 --> 00:21:12.505
And this is the fishing territory
of Mohammed, the yellow.

00:22:16.837 --> 00:22:19.406
Every year, the Zamindar organizes a race

00:22:19.473 --> 00:22:21.875
for the most important families
of the lake.

00:22:21.942 --> 00:22:23.010
For the first time,

00:22:23.076 --> 00:22:25.745
Mohammed, the yellow's family
has been excluded.

00:22:34.588 --> 00:22:37.524
With his new captive,
no one can question his skill.

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:40.126
And Mohammed, the yellow,
regains his full rights.

00:22:41.228 --> 00:22:43.864
Ramzan, the red,
can have no say in the matter.

00:23:27.907 --> 00:23:29.609
To regain full honor,

00:23:31.144 --> 00:23:33.746
Mohammed, the yellow,
has challenged Ramzan

00:23:33.813 --> 00:23:36.650
in the duel
that is most highly prized by the Mohanas.

00:24:52.725 --> 00:24:56.029
The fate of a Mohana
spreads between heaven and water.

00:24:56.430 --> 00:24:59.599
He's born on a boat
and leaves the world on the same boat.

00:25:00.333 --> 00:25:02.802
Confiding a dream to each bird's flight.

00:25:06.272 --> 00:25:10.276
Ramzan and Mohammed's sons
dream that this newfound peace

00:25:10.343 --> 00:25:12.312
has returned for a good, long stay.

00:25:13.280 --> 00:25:15.415
But what can their fathers be dreaming of?

